# No Build Process

Do not run Gulp, npm build scripts, or any minification/compilation steps after editing CSS, JS, or SASS files. The developer handles builds manually at deployment time.

When editing assets, only modify the source files (`.js`, `.scss`, `.css`). Do not attempt to regenerate `.min.js` or `.min.css` files.
